{"title":"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">2004 AMC 12A #9</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">2004 AMC 10A #11</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A company sells peanut butter in cylindrical jars.  Marketing research suggests that using wider jars will increase sales.  If the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Diameter\" title=\"Diameter\">diameter</a> of the jars is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> without altering the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Volume\" title=\"Volume\">volume</a>, by what percent must the height be decreased?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26cfb8566d509d929e51f6c91955f4d2dd463d5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 10 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 25 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 36 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 50 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When the diameter is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, it is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92f7fbfd399817ffc78c526f5668e3315ab3d9e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{5}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />, so the area of the base is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/0/540494f89b773134a7b159ce0f7300b26e04da77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\dfrac54\\right)^2=\\dfrac{25}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"91\" height=\"46\" />.\n</p><p>To keep the volume the same, the height must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f1754305c236f5e31c285bd6a17d6fe4b1ce3a10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{\\frac{25}{16}}=\\dfrac{16}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"66\" height=\"44\" /> of the original height, which is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/219d19a2cd739683cc264acbc4340e000f0bfd5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> reduction. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/c/1cc9458b77c3899bd1ec0830ea3f7a3e10e7bc8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2A_Fh0Kmu88\">https://youtu.be/2A_Fh0Kmu88</a>\n</p><p>Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A\">2004 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">R